cff-version: 1.2.0
title: bible-ai-assistant
abstract: >-
  A locally-hosted, retrieval-grounded Bible Q&A assistant fine-tuned on
  Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B for a single 16 GB consumer GPU. Hybrid RAG (dense + BM25 +
  reciprocal rank fusion + cross-encoder reranking), per-verse citation
  verification, and a versioned, sha-pinned evaluation protocol (v1-v5).
  Current model (v3.2): 80.3% verse-quote exact recall, 98.9% citation rate,
  1.9% hallucination -- verified against 12 models (4 internal iterations +
  8 external comparators, the closest thing to a Bible-LLM benchmark that
  currently exists) through the identical RAG stack.
type: software
authors:
  - name: t-timms
repository-code: https://github.com/t-timms/bible-ai-assistant
url: https://huggingface.co/Ttimms/Bible-Assistant-Qwen3.5-4B-v3.2
license: MIT
